Package: fusionpanel
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: FusionPanel Maintainers <maintainers@fusionpanel.org>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates, libc6 (>= 2.36), openssl, passwd, systemd
Recommends: nginx
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/scherenhaenden/FusionPanel
X-FusionPanel-Source-Commit: @SOURCE_SHA@
X-FusionPanel-Build-Timestamp: @SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH@
Description: FusionPanel control plane, node agent, CLI, and web UI
 FusionPanel provides the control-plane API, node agent, operator CLI,
 privileged Nginx configuration helper, bundled web UI, and systemd units
 for Debian Bookworm (amd64).
